ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CXDsrt_ZQo0Q7kNvwEc1LBe&_nc_oc=Adp_knOG5WgeU8dh9eCEDUnvYLeH5u8iyUiDVf9IqSj47jOqnjqLS5Qf72XBTXLBzOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRkYOsDHzKq8OS8uuDomTmJaPKotNPduzmx61AB6QIULQ&oe=6B0C7986"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nWHF0AspfQEQ7kNvwEG3CYy&_nc_oc=AdpMaBfoUYixMqMxOgGJv8SBQUb2asvMmyLw0h22pzs0lJ7A5u5sD7SUoOUn52Y93JI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ9KzFITU6HZEwf8TS6U39Q7A__IaIAxAinC6GB7nM8MA&oe=6B0C61E0"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j6FUPJ5-YVgQ7kNvwGIhP0w&_nc_oc=AdrDLTB74JvzbNk-QiH7HjC0ege1uNwgKUMEBYd_JZHjq-YrP-8Qa6h7R4TBXneRWvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTxXazwL7_FIQ9S-tWRjXkv33m4YkQlMjpyT-tLzzAQjA&oe=6B0C8091"}, {